  "description": "FAMDEF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C77 H88 Cu2 Dy3 N8 O17 1+,5(C1 H4 O1),C1 H1 Cl3,Cl1 O4 1-,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Cu1 (Cu) has 4 O neighbors; Cu2 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.273-3.849 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.57-113.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy3Cu2(LH)4(MeOH)]ClO4·5MeOH·CHCl3·H2O.",
